%RUN_BASIC_MODEL Run the basic four-chain weekly correlation model.
% Each chain uses 100 warm-up iterations and retains 10,000 draws.
% MaxHours is a 12-hour sampling-stage budget shared by the four chains.
% The pooled 68% mean PDF and separate per-chain mean convergence PDF are
% generated by default, with separate chain means for visual comparison.
% Chains run sequentially unless ParallelChains is explicitly enabled.

project_root = fileparts(fileparts(mfilename('fullpath')));
addpath(project_root);

result = run_weekly_model_report( ...
    NumChains=4, ...
    WarmupIterations=100, ...
    PerDraw=10000, ...
    MaxHours=12);
